### Create employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mahesh",
  "lastName": "Mamidi",
  "email": "mahesh@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "department": "IT",
  "designation": "Junior Software Engineer",
  "salary": 45000.00,
  "dateOfJoining": "2025-06-15"
}

### List employees with filters and sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?department=IT&status=ACTIVE&sortBy=salary&order=desc

### Get employee by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1

### Full update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mahesh",
  "lastName": "Mamidi",
  "email": "mahesh.updated@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "department": "IT",
  "designation": "Software Engineer",
  "salary": 50000.00,
  "dateOfJoining": "2025-06-15"
}

### Deactivate employee
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"INACTIVE"}

### Activate employee
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/search?keyword=mahesh

### List by department
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/department/IT

### Statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/stats

### Permanent delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1

### Failure: invalid employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"M","email":"wrong","phone":"123","salary":-1}

### Failure: missing employee
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/99999

### Failure: unsupported sort field
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?sortBy=password
